wiki.effect:
{{PAGENAME}} causes the priority of all Techniques to invert based on their priority level with the exception of Ultra {{priority|5|40}}. The results of this effect are listed below:

* Very Low{{priority|0|40}} will change to Very High{{priority|4|40}}
* Low{{priority|1|40}} will change to High{{priority|3|40}}
* Normal{{priority|2|40}} will stay Normal{{priority|2|40}}
* High{{priority|3|40}} will change to Low{{priority|1|40}}
* Very High{{priority|4|40}}will change to Very Low{{priority|0|40}}

{{PAGENAME}} activates when the holder starts the turn on the battlefield. When swapping the holder out, {{PAGENAME}} will still activate for that turn.

